---
const title = 'SF Hosting — Private dinners & group drinks in San Francisco';
const description = 'Explore more than 120 San Francisco restaurants, bars, private dining rooms, and casual group hangouts. Compare room sizes, per-person prices, and booking minimums.';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.rhyslindmark.com/tools/sf-hosting" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/leaflet-cluster/MarkerCluster.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/tools/sf-hosting.css?v=4" />
    <script defer src="/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.js"></script>
    <script defer src="/vendor/leaflet-cluster/leaflet.markercluster.js"></script>
    <script defer src="/tools/sf-hosting.js?v=4"></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/tools/sf-hosting" aria-label="SF Hosting home"><span class="brand-mark">✳</span><span>sf hosting</span></a>
      <div class="header-search" role="search">
        <label class="search-segment where-segment"><strong>Where</strong><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="ZIP or neighborhood" aria-label="Search ZIP code, neighborhood, or place" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="where-panel" autocomplete="off" /></label>
        <button class="search-segment search-trigger" id="date-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="date-panel"><strong>When</strong><span id="date-summary">Add dates</span></button>
        <button class="search-segment search-trigger" id="guest-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="guest-panel"><strong>Who</strong><span id="guest-summary">Add guests</span></button>
        <button id="search-submit" class="search-submit" type="button" aria-label="Search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 4.5 4.5"/></svg></button>
        <div id="date-panel" class="search-panel" hidden><h2>When is your gathering?</h2><div class="date-fields"><label>Any time between<input id="date-start" type="date" /></label><label>And<input id="date-end" type="date" /></label></div><p>Choose a flexible window for one gathering. Confirm availability with the venue.</p><button class="panel-done" type="button">Done</button></div>
        <div id="guest-panel" class="search-panel" hidden><h2>How many guests?</h2><p>Filter for places with enough room.</p><div class="guest-picker-head"><label for="guest-number">Guests</label><input id="guest-number" type="number" min="1" max="500" step="1" placeholder="Any size" aria-label="Number of guests" /></div><input id="guest-range" type="range" min="1" max="500" step="1" value="1" aria-label="Guest count" /><div class="guest-range-labels"><span>1 guest</span><span>500 guests</span></div><button id="guest-any" class="guest-any" type="button">Any group size</button><button class="panel-done" type="button">Done</button></div>
        <div id="where-panel" class="search-panel where-panel" hidden><h2>Where in San Francisco?</h2><p>Type a ZIP code or choose a neighborhood.</p><button class="neighborhood-option citywide-option" type="button" data-query="">Anywhere in San Francisco</button><div id="neighborhood-options" class="neighborhood-options"></div><p class="zip-note">ZIP search uses <a href="https://data.sf.gov/dataset/San-Francisco-ZIP-Codes/uq3t-6t53" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DataSF ZIP areas</a>.</p></div>
      </div>
      <a class="header-link" href="/">Rhys Lindmark <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="controls" aria-label="Search filters">
        <div class="filter-actions">
          <button id="filters-button" class="filter-button filters-main" type="button">☷ &nbsp; Filters <span id="filter-count" hidden></span></button>
          <span class="filter-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <button class="type-tab active" type="button" data-type="all" aria-pressed="true">All places</button>
          <button class="type-tab" type="button" data-type="both" aria-pressed="false">Dinner & drinks</button>
          <button class="type-tab" type="button" data-type="dinner" aria-pressed="false">Private dining</button>
          <button class="type-tab" type="button" data-type="drinks" aria-pressed="false">Drinks</button>
          <button class="type-tab" type="button" data-type="dropin" aria-pressed="false">Casual hosting</button>
          <button id="clear-filters" class="clear-button" type="button" hidden>Clear filters</button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="workspace" aria-label="Venue results">
        <div class="results-pane">
          <div class="results-head">
            <div><strong id="result-count">Loading places…</strong><span class="results-subtitle" id="result-context"> in San Francisco</span></div>
            <label class="sort-label">Sort <select id="sort"><option value="recommended">Recommended</option><option value="price-low">Price: low to high</option><option value="capacity-high">Capacity: high to low</option></select></label>
          </div>
          <p id="search-feedback" class="search-feedback" role="status" hidden></p>
          <div id="cards" class="cards" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <div id="empty-state" class="empty-state" hidden><h2>No places in this map area.</h2><p>Move the map or widen your filters.</p><button type="button" id="show-all-matches">Show all matching places</button><button type="button" id="empty-clear">Clear filters</button></div>
          <div class="data-note">Prices and room terms are planning information, not live quotes. Confirm availability, minimum spend, fees, and capacity with the venue. <button id="about-data" type="button">About this guide</button></div>
        </div>
        <aside class="map-pane" aria-label="Map of venues"><div id="map"></div><div class="map-counter" id="map-counter">Loading map…</div></aside>
      </section>
    </main>

    <dialog id="filters-dialog" class="filters-dialog"><div class="filters-dialog-head"><button class="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="Close filters">×</button><strong>Filters</strong><span></span></div><div class="filters-dialog-body"><h2>Price per guest</h2><p>Known starting prices across the guide</p><div id="price-histogram" class="histogram" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="range-labels"><strong id="price-low-label">Any</strong><strong id="price-high-label">Any</strong></div><div class="range-inputs"><label>Minimum<input id="price-min" type="range" min="0" max="500" step="10" value="0" /></label><label>Maximum<input id="price-max" type="range" min="0" max="500" step="10" value="500" /></label></div><small id="price-data-note"></small><hr /><h2>Space minimum</h2><p>Published minimum spend for a room or full space</p><div id="booking-histogram" class="histogram" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="range-labels"><strong id="booking-low-label">Any</strong><strong id="booking-high-label">Any</strong></div><div class="range-inputs"><label>Minimum<input id="booking-min" type="range" min="0" max="30000" step="1" value="0" /></label><label>Maximum<input id="booking-max" type="range" min="0" max="30000" step="1" value="30000" /></label></div><small id="booking-data-note"></small><hr /><h2>Spaces & rooms</h2><div class="room-options"><label><input id="private-only" type="checkbox" /> Private room</label><label><input id="semi-only" type="checkbox" /> Semi-private area</label><label><input id="buyout-only" type="checkbox" /> Full buyout</label><label><input id="dropin-only" type="checkbox" /> Casual drop-in</label></div></div><div class="filters-dialog-foot"><button id="dialog-clear" type="button">Clear all</button><button id="dialog-done" type="button">Show places</button></div></dialog>
    <div id="drawer-backdrop" class="drawer-backdrop" hidden></div>
    <aside id="detail-drawer" class="detail-drawer" aria-label="Venue details" aria-hidden="true"></aside>
    <dialog id="about-dialog" class="about-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="Close">×</button><h2>About this guide</h2><p>This guide combines Rhys’s venue research and group-hosting maps with venue details collected by <a href="https://tablequote.com/directory" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TableQuote</a>. Each listing links to venue information or a map listing.</p><p>Per-person estimates from Rhys’s research include food, drinks, and a 35% allowance for tax and service. Other per-person figures are directory-listed starting menu prices before extras. Booking figures are listed room or food-and-beverage minimums when available, not guaranteed final costs.</p><p>Updated September 2026. Please verify every detail with the venue before booking.</p></dialog>
  </body>
</html>
